==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Diabrollow]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**2 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Othom]]s spawn, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This [[Eternal Ancient Woods]]-esque stage poses low threat with the existence of [[Esoteric Uril]], [[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Bargain]] and [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone]]. Bring a Research [[Cat Combo|Combo]] to help with spamming Bargains/Cones and additional support from units like [[Can Can Cat|Can Can]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling]] and [[Octopus Cat|Octopus]] to make this stage go down rather simply.

